        <mxCell id="e6" edge="1" parent="1" source="seq" style="curved=1;endArrow=block;html=1;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=11;fontColor=#555555;exitX=0;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" target="idle" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(102, 102, 102));&quot;&gt;⑥ 最後一拍完成，釋放 HBUSREQx&lt;br&gt;設定完成／IRQ 狀態位元&lt;/font&gt;">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" x="0.1466" y="-3.35" as="geometry">
